# Per-run state written by the koto checks into whatever directory they run in.
# Never commit these — they are per-person, and a shared one silently corrupts
# every "Change" line by mixing two people's run histories.
.koto-*-state.json

# Reports written by `weekly` mode runs. Anchored to the repo root AND requiring
# a date, because an unanchored `koto-crane-*.md` also matches the command file
# commands/koto-crane-usage.md — which is exactly how it went missing once.
/koto-readers-20*.md
/koto-hub-20*.md
/koto-crane-20*.md
/koto-infra-20*.md

.DS_Store
